---
layout: "base.njk"
home: true
desc: "婺需文学社：甲辰清明立社，以古典诗词为根基，同写现代诗与随笔。"
footerNote: "社中诗文，版权归诸作者。转载务署出处，毋作商用；题名若须更以本名，望告。"
---

<main id="top">

  <!-- ============ Hero ============ -->
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="tagline rv">同人结社 · 以诗会友，以文养心</p>
      <h1 class="rv">婺需文学社</h1>
      <p class="sub rv">甲辰清明，婺州风雨中，我们立社。以古典诗词为根基，也写现代诗与随笔。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions rv">
        <a class="btn" href="#join">申请入社</a>
        <a class="hero-link" href="yaji.html">览读雅集</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-media rv">
      <div class="frame">
        <!-- 本地化占位图(原 picsum 同 seed 下载, 零外链); 日后有社员实拍(山水/烟雨/书斋)直接替换此文件 -->
        <img src="hero-qingming.jpg" width="920" height="1200" alt="烟雨远山，经灰度淡褐处理近似水墨意趣" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 宗旨 ============ -->
  <section class="motto">
    <div class="wrap rv">
      <p class="motto-lines"><span>“文章千古事，</span><span>得失寸心知。”</span></p>
      <cite>杜甫《偶题》句，引为社训</cite>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 缘起 ============ -->
  <section id="origin">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head rv"><h2>缘起</h2><hr class="hair" /></div>
      <div class="origin">
        <div class="rv">
          <p>婺需文学社创立于甲辰清明（2024 年 4 月 4 日）。首聚当日婺州风雨大作，社长 jwl 作《清明会序》以志，六位同好以“清明”为题各赋其作。</p>
          <p>如今同人分属金华、杭州、北京、温州四地，以同题共写维系千里之谊；近体诗、现代诗与随笔，皆可在雅集与作品库中得见。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tenets rv">
          <div class="tenet"><strong>以诗会友</strong><span>每月雅集，读诗、品评、改稿，直言不伤人。</span></div>
          <div class="tenet"><strong>以文养心</strong><span>文字先养自己，再示于人。</span></div>
          <div class="tenet"><strong>旧典新声</strong><span>守格律之正，不避今语之新。</span></div>
          <div class="tenet"><strong>宁少毋滥</strong><span>一篇之成，须经得起重读。</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 随机拾读 ============ -->
  <section id="picks">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head rv"><h2>随机拾读</h2><hr class="hair" /></div>
      <p class="lead rv">满库诗笺，每次打开换四篇——不期而遇，亦算缘分。点篇名读全文与关联作品。</p>
      {% set homePool = collections.works | homeCards %}
      <div class="poem-grid" id="home-picks">
        {% for c in homePool.slice(0, 4) %}
        <article class="poem-item">
          <h3 class="pi-title"><a class="plink" href="{{ c.href }}">{{ c.title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="pi-meta"><span>{{ c.name }}</span><span>{{ c.genre }}</span></p>
          <p class="pi-line">“{{ c.line }}”</p>
          <a class="pi-link" href="{{ c.href }}">读全文与关联作品</a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <script type="application/json" id="home-pool">{{ homePool | toJSON | safe }}</script>
      <script>
      (function () {
        "use strict";
        var grid = document.getElementById("home-picks");
        var dataEl = document.getElementById("home-pool");
        if (!grid || !dataEl) return;
        var pool;
        try { pool = JSON.parse(dataEl.textContent); } catch (e) { return; }
        function build(c) {
          var a = document.createElement("article");
          a.className = "poem-item";
          var h = document.createElement("h3"); h.className = "pi-title";
          var l = document.createElement("a"); l.className = "plink"; l.href = c.href; l.textContent = c.title;
          h.appendChild(l);
          var meta = document.createElement("p"); meta.className = "pi-meta";
          var s1 = document.createElement("span"); s1.textContent = c.name;
          var s2 = document.createElement("span"); s2.textContent = c.genre;
          meta.appendChild(s1); meta.appendChild(s2);
          var line = document.createElement("p"); line.className = "pi-line";
          line.textContent = "“" + c.line + "”";
          var more = document.createElement("a"); more.className = "pi-link"; more.href = c.href;
          more.textContent = "读全文与关联作品";
          a.appendChild(h); a.appendChild(meta); a.appendChild(line); a.appendChild(more);
          return a;
        }
        function render() {
          var arr = pool.slice();
          for (var i = arr.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
            var j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
            var tmp = arr[i]; arr[i] = arr[j]; arr[j] = tmp;
          }
          var frag = document.createDocumentFragment();
          for (var k = 0; k < 4 && k < arr.length; k++) frag.appendChild(build(arr[k]));
          grid.innerHTML = "";
          grid.appendChild(frag);
        }
        render();
      })();
      </script>
      <p class="duo-acts rv">
        <a class="btn ghost" href="members.html">查看社员 · 社员大全</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="library.html">浏览作品库 · 社内文稿总目</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 入社 ============ -->
  <section id="join" class="join">
    <div class="wrap join-in">
      <div>
        <div class="sec-head rv"><h2>邀君入社</h2><hr class="hair" /></div>
        <p class="lead rv">我们常年招收同好。能写的最好，爱读的也欢迎。</p>
        <ul class="rv">
          <li>各地分部定期雅集，线上线下都有；</li>
          <li>新作可入同题合集与社刊编目；</li>
          <li>编委轮流看稿，给具体可改的意见。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <form class="fm rv" id="join-form" novalidate aria-label="入社申请">
        <p style="position:absolute;left:-9999px" aria-hidden="true">
          <label>请勿填写<input type="text" name="botField" id="botField" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        </p>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="penname">笔名或称呼</label>
          <input id="penname" name="penname" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="例：枕月" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="mail">邮箱</label>
          <input id="mail" name="mail" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="region">地区（选填）</label>
          <input id="region" name="region" type="text" list="branch-list" maxlength="30" placeholder="例：浙江金华（或直接选金华总部）" />
          <datalist id="branch-list">
            {% for sec in members %}<option value="{{ sec.branch }}"></option>{% endfor %}
          </datalist>
          <small style="color:var(--dim)">用于分部归属；不填则由编委归入分部（名册先记「待考」）。</small>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="kind">常写的方向</label>
          <select id="kind" name="kind">
            <option value="poem">古诗词</option>
            <option value="modern">现代诗</option>
            <option value="essay">随笔</option>
            <option value="all">都写</option>
            <option value="reader">只读不写</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="note">自我介绍（可选）</label>
          <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="三五句即可"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="btn" type="submit" style="width:100%">申请入社</button>
        <p class="form-msg" id="form-msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
      <script>
      (function () {
        var f = document.getElementById("join-form");
        if (!f) return;
        var msg = document.getElementById("form-msg");
        var btn = f.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
        f.addEventListener("submit", function (ev) {
          ev.preventDefault();
          var data = {
            penname: f.penname.value.trim(),
            mail: f.mail.value.trim(),
            region: f.region.value.trim(),
            kind: f.kind.value,
            note: f.note.value.trim(),
            botField: f.botField.value,
          };
          if (!data.penname || !data.mail) { msg.textContent = "请填写笔名与邮箱。"; return; }
          btn.disabled = true;
          msg.textContent = "正在递送…";
          fetch("{{ site.apiBase | default('/api') }}/join", {
            method: "POST",
            headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
            body: JSON.stringify(data),
          })
            .then(function (r) { return r.json().catch(function () { return {}; }); })
            .then(function (j) {
              if (j && j.ok) {
                f.reset();
                msg.textContent = "申请已递送，编委稍后与你联系。";
              } else {
                msg.textContent = (j && j.error) || "提交失败，请稍后再试或联系社长。";
              }
            })
            .catch(function () { msg.textContent = "网络不通，请稍后再试。"; })
            .then(function () { btn.disabled = false; });
        });
      })();
      </script>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 公众号 ============ -->
  {% if site.wechat and site.wechat.name %}
  <section id="wechat" class="wx">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head rv"><h2>公众号</h2><hr class="hair" /></div>
      <div class="wxbox rv">
        {% if site.wechat.qr %}
        <img class="wx-qr" src="{{ site.wechat.qr }}" width="220" height="220" alt="{{ site.wechat.name }} 公众号二维码" loading="lazy" />
        {% endif %}
        <div class="wx-info">
          <h3>{{ site.wechat.name }}</h3>
          {% if site.wechat.intro %}<p>{{ site.wechat.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
          <p class="wx-tip">微信扫一扫关注 · 亦可在微信内搜索「{{ site.wechat.name }}」</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}


</main>
